TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at 200C and fixed pH
SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    units     mmol/kgw
    Fe(+3)    4
    Fe(+2)    4
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Fix_H+    -2    HCl 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g)    5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0    1
        -m     1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected3.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -pH true
    -pe true
END
